<title>CHINA: China urban incomes up 2.2 pct in first half.</title>
<headline>China urban incomes up 2.2 pct in first half.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban per capita income in the first half of this year rose by a real 2.2 percent after inflation to 2,680 yuan ($322) for the period, the State Statistical Bureau said in a report on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rural per capita income was 980 yuan in the first half, rising by 6.5 percent, or 3.3 percent after inflation, it said.</p>
